*> Test helpers of the item physics tests (test infrastructure, excluded from coverage). COPY this after CORETEST:
*>   ITT-CHECK USING case (PIC X(240)), expected (PIC X(1024)), observed (PIC X(1024)): one text assertion.
*>   ITT-F USING value (FLOAT-LONG), text out (PIC X(16)): the value rounded to 5 decimals, trimmed.
*>   ITT-I USING value (BINARY-LONG), text out (PIC X(16)): the integer, trimmed.
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. ITT-CHECK.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY TESTLIB.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 01 L-CASE                 PIC X(240).
 01 L-EXPECTED             PIC X(1024).
 01 L-OBSERVED             PIC X(1024).
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-CASE L-EXPECTED L-OBSERVED.
     MOVE "T" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE L-CASE TO TL-CASE
     MOVE L-EXPECTED TO TL-EXPECTED
     MOVE L-OBSERVED TO TL-OBSERVED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM ITT-CHECK.

 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. ITT-F.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 WS-EDIT                PIC -(6)9.9(5).
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 01 L-VALUE                FLOAT-LONG.
 01 L-TEXT                 PIC X(16).
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-VALUE L-TEXT.
     COMPUTE WS-EDIT ROUNDED = L-VALUE
     MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-EDIT) TO L-TEXT
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM ITT-F.

 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. ITT-I.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 WS-EDIT                PIC -(9)9.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 01 L-VALUE                BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-TEXT                 PIC X(16).
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-VALUE L-TEXT.
     MOVE L-VALUE TO WS-EDIT
     MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-EDIT) TO L-TEXT
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM ITT-I.

 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. ITT-DESCRIBE.
*> USING tracker row, text out (PIC X(1024)): "x,y,z v vx,vy,vz g ground d delay a age n countxitem".
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY CORESTATE.
 01 WS-A                   PIC X(16).
 01 WS-B                   PIC X(16).
 01 WS-C                   PIC X(16).
 01 WS-PTR                 BINARY-LONG.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 01 L-ROW                  BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-TEXT                 PIC X(1024).
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-ROW L-TEXT.
     MOVE SPACES TO L-TEXT
     MOVE 1 TO WS-PTR
     CALL "ITT-F" USING EN-X(L-ROW) WS-A
     CALL "ITT-F" USING EN-Y(L-ROW) WS-B
     CALL "ITT-F" USING EN-Z(L-ROW) WS-C
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-A) "," FUNCTION TRIM(WS-B) "," FUNCTION TRIM(WS-C) " v " DELIMITED BY SIZE
         INTO L-TEXT POINTER WS-PTR
     CALL "ITT-F" USING EN-VX(L-ROW) WS-A
     CALL "ITT-F" USING EN-VY(L-ROW) WS-B
     CALL "ITT-F" USING EN-VZ(L-ROW) WS-C
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-A) "," FUNCTION TRIM(WS-B) "," FUNCTION TRIM(WS-C) " g " DELIMITED BY SIZE
         INTO L-TEXT POINTER WS-PTR
     CALL "ITT-I" USING EN-ON-GROUND(L-ROW) WS-A
     CALL "ITT-I" USING EN-DELAY(L-ROW) WS-B
     CALL "ITT-I" USING EN-AGE(L-ROW) WS-C
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-A) " d " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-B) " a " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-C) " n " DELIMITED BY SIZE
         INTO L-TEXT POINTER WS-PTR
     CALL "ITT-I" USING EN-ITEM-COUNT(L-ROW) WS-A
     CALL "ITT-I" USING EN-ITEM(L-ROW) WS-B
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-A) "x" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-B) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO L-TEXT POINTER WS-PTR
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM ITT-DESCRIBE.

 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. ITT-V3.
*> USING a, b, c (FLOAT-LONG), text out (PIC X(64)): "a,b,c" with each rounded to 5 decimals.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 WS-A                   PIC X(16).
 01 WS-B                   PIC X(16).
 01 WS-C                   PIC X(16).
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 01 L-A                    FLOAT-LONG.
 01 L-B                    FLOAT-LONG.
 01 L-C                    FLOAT-LONG.
 01 L-TEXT                 PIC X(64).
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-A L-B L-C L-TEXT.
     CALL "ITT-F" USING L-A WS-A
     CALL "ITT-F" USING L-B WS-B
     CALL "ITT-F" USING L-C WS-C
     MOVE SPACES TO L-TEXT
     STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-A) "," FUNCTION TRIM(WS-B) "," FUNCTION TRIM(WS-C) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO L-TEXT
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM ITT-V3.
